    </entryLink>
    <entryLink name="Xiaphas Jurr" id="605c-ca63-fff2-24d5" collective="false" hidden="true" import="false" targetId="30b8-05a5-fef7-fe66" type="selectionEntry">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="HQ:" id="2cd0-a7b4-5354-0ec5" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4f85-eb33-30c9-8f51"/>
        <categoryLink name="Compulsory HQ:" id="2d46-182d-6dc0-bee3" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="f823-8c1d-6a87-26a1"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink name="Disciple of the Flame" id="021a-ee89-b9f1-53c9" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="d554-7321-7d26-feb9" type="selectionEntry">
          <rules>
            <rule name="Disciple of the Flame (Xiaphas)" id="c786-4308-9120-8a6e" hidden="true" page="67" publicationId="d0df-7166-5cd3-89fd">
              <description>You can include this model in a Blackshields Detachment. If you do so, that Detachment must use the Pride is Our Armour and Panoply of Old (Salamanders) Oaths 

When you do so, replace this model’s Legiones Astartes (Salamanders) special rule with the Legiones Astartes (Blackshields) special rule and replace the instance of Legiones Astartes (Salamanders) in this unit’s Beacon of Hope Warlord Trait with Legiones Astartes (Blackshields).</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </entryLink>
      </entryLinks>
      <modifiers>
